{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chirax </strong>is on a mission to save stolen hydra hatchlings from knights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chirax</strong>, being a <strong>hydra</strong>, can grow up to 3 heads at once and launch them at her foes! \u00a0She also functions has the health bar herself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798540/extras/3_headed_chirax.png?t=1751585887\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Platform </strong>your way through <strong>six worlds</strong> all with a <strong>cute hand-drawn pixel art style</strong>, and fight <strong>six unique bosses</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find cool <strong>power-ups </strong>and <strong>abilities</strong>! \u00a0Later on, you can find a power-up that allows Chirax to turn her heads into platforms! \u00a0You'll find blocks that make her heads also act like grappling hooks. \u00a0Sometimes, you can even launch Chirax's heads into the background!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3798540?t=1751585887","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798540/3b4c24bef4b6b60150ee92cac3d270d733cf81ce/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751585887","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798540/78fd56f57e37f8a73efd35bee41a07e0361c3d4d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751585887","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798540/78fd56f57e37f8a73efd35bee41a07e0361c3d4d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751585887","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[]